    "https://esadefaculty.teamtailor.com/jobs/8117979-assistant-professor-in-human-resource-management-or-leadership-tenure-track": {
      "title": "Assistant Professor in Human Resource Management or Leadership (Tenure-Track)",
      "description": "Assistant Professor in Human Resource Management or Leadership (Tenure-Track) - ESADE Faculty Positions This website uses cookies to ensure you get the best experience. ESADE Faculty Positions and our selected partners use cookies and similar technologies (together “cookies”) that are necessary to present this website, and to ensure you get the best experience of it.\n\n          If you consent to it, we will also use cookies for analytics and marketing purposes. See our Cookie Policy to read more about the cookies we set. You can withdraw and manage your consent at any time, by clicking “Manage cookies” at the bottom of each website page. Accept all cookies Decline all non-necessary cookies Cookie preferences Select which cookies you accept On this site, we always set cookies that are strictly necessary, meaning they are necessary for the site to function properly. If you consent to it, we will also set other types of cookies. You can provide or withdraw your consent to the different types of cookies using the toggles below. You can change or withdraw your consent at any time, by clicking the link “Manage Cookies”, which is always available at the bottom of the site. To learn more about what the different types of cookies do, how your data is used when they are set etc, see our Cookie Policy . Strictly necessary These cookies are necessary to make the site work properly, and are always set when you visit the site. Vendors Teamtailor Analytics These cookies collect information to help us understand how the site is being used. Vendors Teamtailor Marketing These cookies are used to make advertising messages more relevant to you. In some cases, they also deliver additional functions on the site. Vendors Youtube Accept these cookies Decline all non-necessary cookies Skip to main content esade.edu People Management and Organisation · Esade Barcelona - Sant Cugat Assistant Professor in Human Resource Management or Leadership (Tenure-Track) https://www.esade.edu/en Apply for this job ESADE Business School i s seeking to appoint a faculty member at the rank of Assistant Professor (tenure track) in the field of Human Resource Management or Leadership . We particularly welcome applications with a special focus on the impact of AI and other smart technologies, data analytics, and/or digital transformation on HR or Leadership practices. The successful candidate will join the School at its Sant Cugat (Barcelona) campus in September 2027. Candidates must have completed a Ph.D. in a field relevant to the position (e.g., Management or Organizational Behavior). They should demonstrate either a record of, or strong potential and motivation for publishing high-quality, impactful research in top tier management journals, as well as the ability and motivation to secure national and international research funding. Candidates should also demonstrate a strong foundation for developing a successful teaching career across the School's diverse portfolio of undergraduate, postgraduate, and executive education programs. Successful candidates are expected to contribute actively to departmental life and engage fully with the wider School community. The Department of People Management and Organization at ESADE offers a vibrant and collaborative environment for research and teaching with regular research seminars, international collaborations, and opportunities to engage with leading scholars in Human Resource Management, Organizational Behavior and Organization Theory. ESADE offers a rigorous and international academic environment for research. The School is home to faculty and students from around the globe and is consistently ranked among the world's leading business Schools (Financial Times, Business Week, The Economist). ESADE is committed to educating responsible leaders and generating knowledge that contributes to organizations and society. It fosters a collaborative academic community where excellence in research and teaching is paired with a commitment to positive societal impact. ESADE comprises a Business School and a Law School spread across three campuses: Barcelona, Sant Cugat del Vallès (near Barcelona), and Madrid. ESADE is a member of Ramon Llull University and offers a broad portfolio of undergraduate, postgraduate, and executive education programs in Business and Law. It has cooperation agreements with many top universities around the globe. All faculty are expected to play a full part in the life of the School and contribute to a collaborative, inclusive, and high-quality academic environment. They are expected to demonstrate collegiality, engage actively within their subject area, and contribute to the wider School community in line with ESADE's values. The compensation and teaching requirements that accompany this position are competitive. New faculty benefit from a comprehensive onboarding program, a reduced teaching load during their initial years, dedicated research funding, and faculty mentoring. The position is tenure-track. Decisions about contract renewal and promotion are based on individual performance. Speaking Spanish or Catalan is not a requirement, though support in learning languages can be provided if desired. Applications will be considered on an ongoing basis starting July 2026 until the position is filled. To be considered, please make sure your application package contains: Cover letter Curriculum Vitae Research statement A recent publication Teaching statement Teaching evaluations (if available) The names and contact details of three people who have agreed to act as possible referees Any other material that may help the selection committee Interested parties should apply online through ESADE’s webpage. We are pleased to inform you that members of the Department will be attending the Academy of Management (AOM) Annual Meeting in Philadelphia in August. Candidates who will be attending AOM and would like to learn more about ESADE and the position are invited to email the Department Chair ( daniela.noethen@esade.edu ) to express their interest in meeting with faculty members. Submission of a complete application is not required in order to be considered for an AOM meeting. Please note that AOM meetings are informal and are not part of the formal selection process. Applications will be reviewed only after the official search begins following the AOM Annual Meeting. Department People Management and Organisation Locations Esade Barcelona - Sant Cugat Apply for this job People Management and Organisation · Esade Barcelona - Sant Cugat Assistant Professor in Human Resource Management or Leadership (Tenure-Track) https://www.esade.edu/en Loading application form Close modal Start Jobs Data & privacy Manage cookies X Facebook LinkedIn Instagram esade.edu Employee login Candidate Connect login Already working at ESADE Faculty Positions? Let’s recruit together and find your next colleague. @esade.edu Log in Applicant tracking system by Teamtailor"
    },
