      "title": "Assistant Professor of Management (Tenure-Track)",
      "description": "Assistant Professor of Management (Tenure-Track) - ESADE Faculty Positions This website uses cookies to ensure you get the best experience. ESADE Faculty Positions and our selected partners use cookies and similar technologies (together “cookies”) that are necessary to present this website, and to ensure you get the best experience of it.\n\n          If you consent to it, we will also use cookies for analytics and marketing purposes. See our Cookie Policy to read more about the cookies we set. You can withdraw and manage your consent at any time, by clicking “Manage cookies” at the bottom of each website page. Accept all cookies Decline all non-necessary cookies Cookie preferences Select which cookies you accept On this site, we always set cookies that are strictly necessary, meaning they are necessary for the site to function properly. If you consent to it, we will also set other types of cookies. You can provide or withdraw your consent to the different types of cookies using the toggles below. You can change or withdraw your consent at any time, by clicking the link “Manage Cookies”, which is always available at the bottom of the site. To learn more about what the different types of cookies do, how your data is used when they are set etc, see our Cookie Policy . Strictly necessary These cookies are necessary to make the site work properly, and are always set when you visit the site. Vendors Teamtailor Analytics These cookies collect information to help us understand how the site is being used. Vendors Teamtailor Marketing These cookies are used to make advertising messages more relevant to you. In some cases, they also deliver additional functions on the site. Vendors Youtube Accept these cookies Decline all non-necessary cookies Skip to main content esade.edu Strategy and General Management · Esade Barcelona - Sant Cugat Assistant Professor of Management (Tenure-Track) https://www.esade.edu/en Apply for this job The Strategy and General Management Department at ESADE Business School (Barcelona, Spain) is seeking applicants for a full-time, tenure-track faculty position at the Assistant Professor level. Applicants with research interests in Strategy, Entrepreneurship, and Organization and Management Theory are invited to apply. Starting date: Fall, 2027 The Department is committed to fostering a collegial academic environment that nurtures individual growth while striving for academic excellence. It is a community of scholars with diverse research interests, passionate about their work and dedicated to making impactful contributions to the field of management through publications in leading journals such as Administrative Science Quarterly, Strategic Management Journal, Academy of Management Journal, Organization Science, Journal of Management, Journal of Management Studies, Journal of Business Venturing, among others. As part of our faculty, you will be expected to: · Conduct high-quality research in the field of Strategy, Entrepreneurship, or Organization and Management Theory, leading to publication in top-tier academic journals. · Teach core courses in Strategy at various levels, including Bachelor, Master of Science, MBA, Executive Education, and Ph.D. · Actively participate in departmental and university activities. · Mentor and guide students in their academic and professional development. · Apply for external research funding. The successful applicant will possess: · A completed Ph.D. in Management or a closely related field by the start date of the appointment. · A proven record of, or potential for, rigorous and impactful research. · Excellent interpersonal and communication skills in English. · A commitment to diversity, equity, and inclusion in academia. To apply, please submit the following before September 10, 2026 : · Cover letter · Curriculum Vitae · Research Statement · Teaching Statement (and evaluations if available) · Two research papers or publications · 3 reference letters (to be submitted directly by the referees to facultypositions@esade.edu clearly indicating the candidate’s name and position) Review of applications will begin immediately after the closing date and continue until the position is filled. For any further queries about the application process, please contact strategy.recruitment@esade.edu Department Strategy and General Management Locations Esade Barcelona - Sant Cugat Apply for this job Strategy and General Management · Esade Barcelona - Sant Cugat Assistant Professor of Management (Tenure-Track) https://www.esade.edu/en Loading application form Close modal Start Jobs Data & privacy Manage cookies X Facebook LinkedIn Instagram esade.edu Employee login Candidate Connect login Already working at ESADE Faculty Positions? Let’s recruit together and find your next colleague. @esade.edu Log in Applicant tracking system by Teamtailor"
    },
    "https://esadefaculty.teamtailor.com/jobs/8057006-operations-management-and-or-scm": {
      "title": "Operations Management and/or SCM",
      "description": "Operations Management and/or SCM - ESADE Faculty Positions This website uses cookies to ensure you get the best experience. ESADE Faculty Positions and our selected partners use cookies and similar technologies (together “cookies”) that are necessary to present this website, and to ensure you get the best experience of it.\n\n          If you consent to it, we will also use cookies for analytics and marketing purposes. See our Cookie Policy to read more about the cookies we set. You can withdraw and manage your consent at any time, by clicking “Manage cookies” at the bottom of each website page. Accept all cookies Decline all non-necessary cookies Cookie preferences Select which cookies you accept On this site, we always set cookies that are strictly necessary, meaning they are necessary for the site to function properly. If you consent to it, we will also set other types of cookies. You can provide or withdraw your consent to the different types of cookies using the toggles below. You can change or withdraw your consent at any time, by clicking the link “Manage Cookies”, which is always available at the bottom of the site. To learn more about what the different types of cookies do, how your data is used when they are set etc, see our Cookie Policy . Strictly necessary These cookies are necessary to make the site work properly, and are always set when you visit the site. Vendors Teamtailor Analytics These cookies collect information to help us understand how the site is being used. Vendors Teamtailor Marketing These cookies are used to make advertising messages more relevant to you. In some cases, they also deliver additional functions on the site. Vendors Youtube Accept these cookies Decline all non-necessary cookies Skip to main content esade.edu Operations, Innovation, and Technology Management (OITM) · Esade Barcelona - Sant Cugat Operations Management and/or SCM https://www.esade.edu/en Apply for this job The Department of Operations, Innovation, and Technology Management (OITM) at Esade Business School invites applications for a full-time, practitioner-track faculty position (Lecturer) in Operations Management/Supply Chain Management. Starting date: Fall, 2027. Candidates must have completed a PhD in Operations Management, Supply Chain Management or related field, or an equivalent program of study, by the start date, and possess research experience. While not essential, prior professional experience in areas such as consulting or similar fields will be positively valued. The candidate must also demonstrate a clear foundation for building a successful teaching career across Esade’s diverse portfolio of undergraduate, postgraduate, and executive education programs. The Department of Operations, Innovation, and Technology Management at ESADE is a growing and dynamic group focused on tackling issues that concern the study of Operations Management, Supply Chain Management, Innovation and Technology Management. Under this broad motivation, our research spans different orientations and methodologies, placing as much importance on theoretical research as on the empirical approach. From the standpoint of teaching, we constantly strive to improve the classroom experience and translate our research interests and findings to ideas and advice that is of practical use. This effort is aided by the school’s Centre for Excellence in Teaching and Learning. ESADE , which comprises a business and a law school, is a member of the Ramon Llull University. The stated mission is “to educate highly-professional individuals aware of their responsibilities as national and global citizens, sensitive to issues of solidarity and social justice, and keen to engage in collective projects,” and the tagline is “do good do better.” The school currently operates campuses in Barcelona and Madrid, and it has several collaboration agreements with renowned international educational institutions. The position is for practitioner-track candidates (Lecturer position). Decisions about contract renewal and promotion are based on teaching, research, and service. The salary and teaching requirements tied to the position are competitive. Almost all teaching, and all official communications in the school are conducted in English. Knowledge of Spanish is not required, but for non-Spanish-speaking candidates language support is provided, if desired. Interested parties should send, through the application system at least the following: • Cover letter • Curriculum vitae • Research Statement • Teaching Statement • One current paper • Any available teaching evaluation • The name and contact details of 3 referees (letters of recommendation will be requested only if the candidate is shortlisted) Applications will be reviewed on a rolling basis starting immediately and continuing until the position is filled. The deadline to apply is October 1st , though candidates are encouraged to apply early, as review begins as soon as the process opens. For any questions about the application process, please contact cristina.sancha@esade.edu including [POSITIONS OITM 2027] in the subject line. Department Operations, Innovation, and Technology Management (OITM) Locations Esade Barcelona - Sant Cugat Apply for this job Operations, Innovation, and Technology Management (OITM) · Esade Barcelona - Sant Cugat Operations Management and/or SCM https://www.esade.edu/en Loading application form Close modal Start Jobs Data & privacy Manage cookies X Facebook LinkedIn Instagram esade.edu Employee login Candidate Connect login Already working at ESADE Faculty Positions? Let’s recruit together and find your next colleague. @esade.edu Log in Applicant tracking system by Teamtailor"
